<title>MALAYSIA: KL Industries, two other stocks suspended.</title>
<headline>KL Industries, two other stocks suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The shares of Kuala Lumpur Industries Holdings Bhd, Rahman Hydraulic Tin Bhd and Westmont Land (Asia) Bhd were all suspended on Wednesday at the companies' requests, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Shares of Kuala Lumpur Industries, a property and consumer products firm, closed at 2.96 ringgit on Tuesday. A company spokeswoman declined to disclose the reason for the suspension.</p>
